    {
      "id": "claim_44d39a0267ae4a9cb3287494f3ae95b6",
      "statement": "With Cloud Native Buildpacks, you can create Docker compatible images that you can run anywhere. Spring Boot includes buildpack support directly for both Maven and Gradle. This means you can just type a single command and quickly get a sensible image into your locally running Docker daemon.",
